            <note corresp="#d236-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d236-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 396.1–GE/7–2655. Secret. Drafted by
                    Byrne. Repeated for information to Phnom Penh, Vientiane, New Delhi, Ottawa,
                    Paris, and London.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
